(ns kaikei.journal
  "kaikei 会計判断コア — aiueos guest（pure judgment, :effects #{}）。

  journal-entry（仕訳検証）と trial-balance（試算表照合）の判定だけを持つ。
  I/O・署名・複製・L2 anchor はこの guest の外（design 正本: docs/aiueos-dapp.md）。
  入力は i64 ベクトルの平坦布局（[debit credit] × n 等）。vector 型を
  使うため KIR v4 / kotoba.typed/externref-v1（typed-value ABI）であり、実行
  host は kototama-browser-host-v1（amu selfhost の typed ホスト）。
  金額は最小通貨単位（JPY は 1 円）の整数。

  バッファ布局:
  - 仕訳 1 件: [debit credit] × n 行
  - 帳簿:      [account debit credit] × n 行
  - 帳票:      [date class debit credit] × n 行（date は yyyymmdd の整数）
  - 請求書 1 件: [rate amount] × n 行（rate は basis points: 1000 = 10%、
    800 = 8%。非課税・免税・不課税は 0。値引きの行の amount は負でよい）
  - 明細:      [amount balance] × n 行（amount は入金が正・出金が負、balance は
    その行の後の残高。残高の無い形式では 0 を入れ、running-break は使わない）
  - 未消込の請求書: [open] × n（同じ取引先の残額を、期日の順に並べたもの）

  validate-entry のエラービット（0 = 正常。条件は重複しうる）:
    1 :empty       行が無い
    2 :odd-buffer  長さが 2 の倍数でない（壊れた入力）
    4 :negative    金額が負
    8 :zero-line   借方・貸方がともに 0 の行
   16 :both-sides  1 行で借方・貸方がともに正
   32 :unbalanced  借方合計 ≠ 貸方合計

  区分（class）— 帳票の判定はこの符号だけを見る。勘定科目名・各社の型からの
  写し方は adapter（src/kaikei/core.cljk）が持つ:
    0 未分類          帳票に数えない（unclassified-count が数える）
    1 流動資産  2 固定資産  3 繰延資産                     借方が正（B/S）
    4 流動負債  5 固定負債  6 純資産                       貸方が正（B/S）
    7 売上高                10 営業外収益  12 特別利益      貸方が正（P/L）
    8 売上原価  9 販管費    11 営業外費用  13 特別損失
    14 法人税等                                            借方が正（P/L）

  段階利益（profit-stage の stage）:
    1 売上総利益 = 7 − 8      2 営業利益 = 1 − 9
    3 経常利益 = 2 + 10 − 11  4 税引前当期純利益 = 3 + 12 − 13
    5 当期純利益 = 4 − 14     （範囲外の stage は 0）

  請求書（第 3 スライス、Linear JUN-321）:
    mode     0 税抜（amount は税抜） 1 税込（amount は税込） 2 税なし
    rounding 0 切捨て 1 四捨五入 2 切上げ（絶対値で丸めて符号を戻す）
    税率ごとの消費税額は、税率ごとに合計した対価に 1 回だけ掛けて丸める
    （消費税法施行令 70 条の 10、基通 1-8-15。丸めの向きは任意 —— 国税庁
    Q&A 問 57）。税抜は 合計 × rate / 10000、税込は 合計 × rate / (10000 + rate)。
    掛け算は base = a·d + b に分けて a·rate + R(b·rate / d) とし、i64 を
    あふれさせない（JS の数で写す adapter とも同じ値になる）。
    tax-share は行への割り当て: 他の行は行の税額を切り捨て、差は同じ税率で
    いちばん大きい行（同額なら上の行）が持つ。和は rate-tax と一致する。
    deduction-percent は仕入税額控除の割合（適格なら 100、そうでなければ
    経過措置。国税庁 Q&A 問 113 の 80 → 70 → 50 → 30）。

  明細・消込・仕訳の候補（第 4 スライス、Linear JUN-327）:
    days-between は 1970-01-01 からの日数の差（H. Hinnant の days_from_civil、
    年は 1 以上）。consumption-rate は消費税と地方消費税を合わせた税率で、
    確かめた表（2014-04-01 から 8%、2019-10-01 から 10%・軽減 8%）の外は -1。
    2027-04-01 からの飲食料品（kind 1）も -1（1% にする法案の段階。国税庁
    リーフレット 令和 8 年 9 月）。消込の強さ（match-level）は点数の重みでは
    なく段の順: 3 有力（金額が合い、番号か名前が合う）、2 中（名前の前方一致）、
    1 弱い（金額だけ、または一部・過入金で番号か名前が合う）、0 出さない。

  B/S の照合は「資産 = 負債 + 純資産 + 損益の累計」。期間で切った損益
  （前期までの繰越分と当期分）の和は累計なので、bs-difference は date ≤ to の
  区分つき行の純額の総和になる（0 なら一致）。

  test-* は test/fixtures/parity.edn の帳票の行を関数ごとに 1 本へ写したもの
  （class-valid? 4 / normal-sign 4 / period-net 5 / class-balance 4 /
    profit-stage 8 / unclassified-count 3 / bs-difference 3 /
    statement-balanced? 3 / statement-buffer-valid? 6）。表を変えたらここも
  変える。test/kaikei/parity_test.cljk がこの関数別件数を表と照合する。
  仕訳 1 件の検証と帳簿の照合（test-valid-entry … test-account-net）も同じ表に
  載っている（validate-entry 7 / entry-balanced? 2 / ledger-balanced? 2 /
  account-net 1）。請求書の行も同じ表にあり、test-* に写してある
  （rate-base 3 / rate-tax 15 / invoice-tax 6 / invoice-total 3 / rate-net 3 /
    tax-share 10 / invoice-buffer-valid? 6 / registration-format? 4 /
    deduction-percent 8）。第 4 スライスの行も同じ（days-between 9 /
    consumption-rate 11 / aging-bucket 9 / running-break 4 / closing-gap 3 /
    line-buffer-valid? 5 / payment-kind 8 / cover-count 7 / allocate 5 /
    date-fit 5 / match-level 9 / suggestion-level 7）。

  テストは export されたゼロ引数 `test-*`（戻り 1/0。実測で true 返しは
  通らない — and/or/= は整数を返す）。fuel は関数の入口ごとに 1 減る。
  profit-stage は 1 回で帳簿を 7 回なめるので、test-profit-stage（8 回呼ぶ）は
  amu test の既定 512 では足りない（実測: 1000 で不足、2000 で足りる）。
  記述子の実行時の上限は 5,000,000。実行:
  <kotoba-lang>/amu/bin/amu test aiueos/kaikei_journal.cljk --fuel 4096"
  (:export [main validate-entry entry-balanced? ledger-balanced? account-net
            class-valid? normal-sign period-net class-balance profit-stage
            unclassified-count bs-difference statement-balanced?
            statement-buffer-valid?
            rate-base rate-tax invoice-tax invoice-total rate-net tax-share
            invoice-buffer-valid? registration-format? deduction-percent
            days-between consumption-rate aging-bucket running-break closing-gap
            line-buffer-valid? payment-kind cover-count allocate date-fit
            match-level suggestion-level
            test-valid-entry test-empty test-odd-buffer test-negative
            test-zero-line test-both-sides test-unbalanced
            test-entry-balanced test-ledger-balanced test-account-net
            test-class-valid test-normal-sign test-period-net
            test-class-balance test-profit-stage test-unclassified-count
            test-bs-difference test-statement-balanced
            test-statement-buffer-valid
            test-rate-base test-rate-tax test-invoice-tax test-invoice-total
            test-rate-net test-tax-share test-invoice-buffer-valid
            test-registration-format test-deduction-percent
            test-days-between test-consumption-rate test-aging-bucket
            test-running-break test-closing-gap test-line-buffer-valid
            test-payment-kind test-cover-count test-allocate test-date-fit
            test-match-level test-suggestion-level]))

(defn main [] :i64
  0)

;; --- 仕訳 1 件の検証: [debit credit] × n ---------------------------------

(defn validate-entry [buf :vector-i64] :i64
  (let [n (vector-count buf)]
    (if (= n 0)
      1
      (if (= n (* 2 (quot n 2)))
        (validate-entry-lines buf n 0 0 0 0)
        2))))

(defn- validate-entry-lines [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 i :i64 bad :i64 total-d :i64 total-c :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (let [d (vector-at buf i)
          c (vector-at buf (+ i 1))]
      (validate-entry-lines buf n (+ i 2)
                            (if (or (< d 0) (< c 0))
                              (+ bad 4)
                              (if (and (= d 0) (= c 0))
                                (+ bad 8)
                                (if (and (> d 0) (> c 0))
                                  (+ bad 16)
                                  bad)))
                            (+ total-d d)
                            (+ total-c c)))
    (if (= total-d total-c)
      bad
      (+ bad 32))))

(defn entry-balanced? [buf :vector-i64] :i64
  (if (= (validate-entry buf) 0) 1 0))

;; --- 帳簿: [account debit credit] × n ------------------------------------

(defn ledger-balanced? [buf :vector-i64] :i64
  (let [n (vector-count buf)]
    (if (= n (* 3 (quot n 3)))
      (ledger-totals buf n 0 0 0)
      0)))

(defn- ledger-totals [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 i :i64 total-d :i64 total-c :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (ledger-totals buf n (+ i 3)
                   (+ total-d (vector-at buf (+ i 1)))
                   (+ total-c (vector-at buf (+ i 2))))
    (if (= total-d total-c) 1 0)))

(defn account-net [buf :vector-i64 account :i64] :i64
  (account-net-at buf (vector-count buf) account 0 0))

(defn- account-net-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 account :i64 i :i64 net :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (account-net-at buf n account (+ i 3)
                    (if (= (vector-at buf i) account)
                      (+ net (- (vector-at buf (+ i 1)) (vector-at buf (+ i 2))))
                      net))
    net))

;; --- 帳票: [date class debit credit] × n --------------------------------

(defn class-valid? [c :i64] :i64
  (if (and (>= c 1) (<= c 14)) 1 0))

(defn normal-sign [c :i64] :i64
  (cond
    (= (class-valid? c) 0) 0
    (<= c 3) 1
    (<= c 6) -1
    (or (= c 7) (= c 10) (= c 12)) -1
    :else 1))

(defn period-net [buf :vector-i64 c :i64 from :i64 to :i64] :i64
  (period-net-at buf (vector-count buf) c from to 0 0))

(defn- period-net-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 c :i64 from :i64 to :i64 i :i64 net :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (let [d (vector-at buf i)]
      (period-net-at buf n c from to (+ i 4)
                     (if (and (= (vector-at buf (+ i 1)) c) (>= d from) (<= d to))
                       (+ net (- (vector-at buf (+ i 2)) (vector-at buf (+ i 3))))
                       net)))
    net))

(defn class-balance [buf :vector-i64 c :i64 from :i64 to :i64] :i64
  (* (normal-sign c) (period-net buf c from to)))

(defn profit-stage [buf :vector-i64 stage :i64 from :i64 to :i64] :i64
  (if (and (>= stage 1) (<= stage 5))
    (let [gross (- (class-balance buf 7 from to) (class-balance buf 8 from to))
          operating (- gross (class-balance buf 9 from to))
          ordinary (- (+ operating (class-balance buf 10 from to)) (class-balance buf 11 from to))
          pre-tax (- (+ ordinary (class-balance buf 12 from to)) (class-balance buf 13 from to))
          net (- pre-tax (class-balance buf 14 from to))]
      (cond
        (= stage 1) gross
        (= stage 2) operating
        (= stage 3) ordinary
        (= stage 4) pre-tax
        :else net))
    0))

(defn unclassified-count [buf :vector-i64] :i64
  (unclassified-at buf (vector-count buf) 0 0))

(defn- unclassified-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 i :i64 k :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (unclassified-at buf n (+ i 4) (+ k (- 1 (class-valid? (vector-at buf (+ i 1))))))
    k))

(defn bs-difference [buf :vector-i64 to :i64] :i64
  (bs-difference-at buf (vector-count buf) to 0 0))

(defn- bs-difference-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 to :i64 i :i64 net :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (bs-difference-at buf n to (+ i 4)
                      (if (and (= (class-valid? (vector-at buf (+ i 1))) 1) (<= (vector-at buf i) to))
                        (+ net (- (vector-at buf (+ i 2)) (vector-at buf (+ i 3))))
                        net))
    net))

(defn statement-balanced? [buf :vector-i64 to :i64] :i64
  (if (and (= (unclassified-count buf) 0) (= (bs-difference buf to) 0)) 1 0))

(defn statement-buffer-valid? [buf :vector-i64] :i64
  (let [n (vector-count buf)]
    (if (= n (* 4 (quot n 4)))
      (statement-buffer-at buf n 0)
      0)))

(defn- statement-buffer-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 i :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (let [c (vector-at buf (+ i 1))]
      (if (and (>= (vector-at buf i) 0)
               (>= c 0) (<= c 14)
               (>= (vector-at buf (+ i 2)) 0)
               (>= (vector-at buf (+ i 3)) 0))
        (statement-buffer-at buf n (+ i 4))
        0))
    1))

;; --- 請求書: [rate amount] × n ------------------------------------------

(defn- round-div [n :i64 d :i64 rounding :i64] :i64
  (let [q (quot n d)
        r (- n (* q d))]
    (cond
      (= rounding 0) q
      (= rounding 1) (if (>= (* 2 r) d) (+ q 1) q)
      :else (if (> r 0) (+ q 1) q))))

(defn- magnitude [x :i64] :i64
  (if (< x 0) (- 0 x) x))

(defn- scaled [base :i64 rate :i64 d :i64 rounding :i64] :i64
  (let [m (magnitude base)
        a (quot m d)
        b (- m (* a d))
        v (+ (* a rate) (round-div (* b rate) d rounding))]
    (if (< base 0) (- 0 v) v)))

(defn- denominator [mode :i64 rate :i64] :i64
  (if (= mode 0) 10000 (+ 10000 rate)))

(defn rate-base [buf :vector-i64 rate :i64] :i64
  (rate-base-at buf (vector-count buf) rate 0 0))

(defn- rate-base-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 rate :i64 i :i64 acc :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (rate-base-at buf n rate (+ i 2)
                  (if (= (vector-at buf i) rate) (+ acc (vector-at buf (+ i 1))) acc))
    acc))

(defn rate-tax [buf :vector-i64 rate :i64 mode :i64 rounding :i64] :i64
  (if (= mode 2)
    0
    (scaled (rate-base buf rate) rate (denominator mode rate) rounding)))

(defn- first-rate-at [buf :vector-i64 rate :i64 i :i64] :i64
  (if (= (vector-at buf i) rate) i (first-rate-at buf rate (+ i 2))))

(defn invoice-tax [buf :vector-i64 mode :i64 rounding :i64] :i64
  (invoice-tax-at buf (vector-count buf) mode rounding 0 0))

(defn- invoice-tax-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 mode :i64 rounding :i64 i :i64 acc :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (let [rate (vector-at buf i)]
      (invoice-tax-at buf n mode rounding (+ i 2)
                      (if (= (first-rate-at buf rate 0) i)
                        (+ acc (rate-tax buf rate mode rounding))
                        acc)))
    acc))

(defn- amount-sum [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 i :i64 acc :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n) (amount-sum buf n (+ i 2) (+ acc (vector-at buf (+ i 1)))) acc))

(defn invoice-total [buf :vector-i64 mode :i64 rounding :i64] :i64
  (let [sum (amount-sum buf (vector-count buf) 0 0)]
    (if (= mode 0) (+ sum (invoice-tax buf mode rounding)) sum)))

(defn rate-net [buf :vector-i64 rate :i64 mode :i64 rounding :i64] :i64
  (if (= mode 1)
    (- (rate-base buf rate) (rate-tax buf rate mode rounding))
    (rate-base buf rate)))

(defn- anchor-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 rate :i64 i :i64 best :i64 best-mag :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (if (and (= (vector-at buf i) rate) (> (magnitude (vector-at buf (+ i 1))) best-mag))
      (anchor-at buf n rate (+ i 2) (quot i 2) (magnitude (vector-at buf (+ i 1))))
      (anchor-at buf n rate (+ i 2) best best-mag))
    best))

(defn- others-share [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 rate :i64 d :i64 skip :i64 i :i64 acc :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (others-share buf n rate d skip (+ i 2)
                  (if (= (vector-at buf i) rate)
                    (if (= (quot i 2) skip) acc (+ acc (scaled (vector-at buf (+ i 1)) rate d 0)))
                    acc))
    acc))

(defn tax-share [buf :vector-i64 line :i64 mode :i64 rounding :i64] :i64
  (let [n (vector-count buf)
        rate (vector-at buf (* 2 line))
        d (denominator mode rate)]
    (cond
      (= mode 2) 0
      (= (anchor-at buf n rate 0 -1 -1) line)
      (- (rate-tax buf rate mode rounding) (others-share buf n rate d line 0 0))
      :else (scaled (vector-at buf (+ (* 2 line) 1)) rate d 0))))

(defn invoice-buffer-valid? [buf :vector-i64] :i64
  (let [n (vector-count buf)]
    (if (= n (* 2 (quot n 2)))
      (invoice-buffer-at buf n 0)
      0)))

(defn- invoice-buffer-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 i :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (let [rate (vector-at buf i)]
      (if (and (>= rate 0) (<= rate 10000)
               (<= (magnitude (vector-at buf (+ i 1))) 900000000000000)
               (>= (rate-base buf rate) 0))
        (invoice-buffer-at buf n (+ i 2))
        0))
    1))

;; 登録番号の形: 「T」（84）＋数字（48..57）13 桁の 14 文字。codes は文字の
;; 符号位置の列（全角→半角・T の後の「-」の除去は adapter が先に行う）。
(defn registration-format? [codes :vector-i64] :i64
  (if (and (= (vector-count codes) 14) (= (vector-at codes 0) 84))
    (registration-digits-at codes 1)
    0))

(defn- registration-digits-at [codes :vector-i64 i :i64] :i64
  (if (< i 14)
    (if (and (>= (vector-at codes i) 48) (<= (vector-at codes i) 57))
      (registration-digits-at codes (+ i 1))
      0)
    1))

;; 仕入税額控除の割合（%）。date は課税仕入れの日（yyyymmdd）、qualified は
;; 適格請求書発行事業者からの仕入れなら 1。
(defn deduction-percent [date :i64 qualified :i64] :i64
  (cond
    (= qualified 1) 100
    (< date 20231001) 100
    (< date 20261001) 80
    (< date 20281001) 70
    (< date 20301001) 50
    (< date 20311001) 30
    :else 0))

;; === 第 4 スライス（JUN-327）: 明細・消込・仕訳の候補 =====================

;; --- 日付 ------------------------------------------------------------------

;; 1970-01-01 からの日数（H. Hinnant の days_from_civil。年は 1 以上）。
(defn- days-from-civil [date :i64] :i64
  (let [y0 (quot date 10000)
        m (- (quot date 100) (* 100 y0))
        d (- date (* 100 (quot date 100)))
        y (if (<= m 2) (- y0 1) y0)
        era (quot y 400)
        yoe (- y (* era 400))
        mp (if (> m 2) (- m 3) (+ m 9))
        doy (+ (quot (+ (* 153 mp) 2) 5) (- d 1))
        doe (+ (* yoe 365) (quot yoe 4) (- 0 (quot yoe 100)) doy)]
    (+ (* era 146097) doe -719468)))

(defn days-between [from :i64 to :i64] :i64
  (- (days-from-civil to) (days-from-civil from)))

;; 消費税と地方消費税を合わせた税率（basis points）。kind 0 標準、1 飲食料品
;; （軽減）、2 定期購読の新聞（軽減）。分からなければ -1: 2014-04-01 より前
;; （一次資料で確かめた表の外）と、2027-04-01 からの飲食料品（1% にする法案の
;; 段階。国税庁リーフレット 令和8年9月）。
(defn consumption-rate [date :i64 kind :i64] :i64
  (cond
    (< date 20140401) -1
    (< date 20191001) 800
    (= kind 0) 1000
    (= kind 2) 800
    (< date 20270401) 800
    :else -1))

;; 売掛・買掛の年齢: 0 期日前、1 期日から 1〜30 日、2 31〜60 日、3 61〜90 日、4 91 日〜。
(defn aging-bucket [due :i64 as-of :i64] :i64
  (let [late (days-between due as-of)]
    (cond
      (<= late 0) 0
      (<= late 30) 1
      (<= late 60) 2
      (<= late 90) 3
      :else 4)))

;; --- 明細 ----------------------------------------------------------------

;; 残高の続き具合: opening から amount を足していき、balance と食い違う最初の
;; 行の番号。すべて合えば -1。
(defn running-break [buf :vector-i64 opening :i64] :i64
  (running-break-at buf (vector-count buf) 0 opening))

(defn- running-break-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 i :i64 balance :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (let [next (+ balance (vector-at buf i))]
      (if (= next (vector-at buf (+ i 1)))
        (running-break-at buf n (+ i 2) next)
        (quot i 2)))
    -1))

;; 期首残高 + 明細の和 − 期末残高（0 なら合う）。balance の列は見ない。
(defn closing-gap [buf :vector-i64 opening :i64 closing :i64] :i64
  (- (closing-sum buf (vector-count buf) 0 opening) closing))

(defn- closing-sum [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 i :i64 acc :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n) (closing-sum buf n (+ i 2) (+ acc (vector-at buf i))) acc))

(defn line-buffer-valid? [buf :vector-i64] :i64
  (let [n (vector-count buf)]
    (if (= n (* 2 (quot n 2)))
      (line-buffer-at buf n 0)
      0)))

(defn- line-buffer-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 i :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (if (and (<= (magnitude (vector-at buf i)) 900000000000000)
             (<= (magnitude (vector-at buf (+ i 1))) 900000000000000))
      (line-buffer-at buf n (+ i 2))
      0)
    1))

;; --- 消込 ----------------------------------------------------------------

;; 1 件の請求書の未回収額 due と入金額 received の関係:
;; 0 なし、1 一致、2 手数料の分だけ少ない（0 < due − received ≤ max-fee）、
;; 3 一部、4 多い。
(defn payment-kind [due :i64 received :i64 max-fee :i64] :i64
  (cond
    (or (<= due 0) (<= received 0)) 0
    (= due received) 1
    (> received due) 4
    (<= (- due received) max-fee) 2
    :else 3))

;; 古い順の未回収額 buf の先頭 k 件の和が、received と一致するか手数料の分だけ
;; 多い最小の k（1 件の入金で複数の請求書）。無ければ 0。
(defn cover-count [buf :vector-i64 received :i64 max-fee :i64] :i64
  (if (<= received 0)
    0
    (cover-count-at buf (vector-count buf) received max-fee 0 0)))

(defn- cover-count-at [buf :vector-i64 n :i64 received :i64 max-fee :i64 i :i64 sum :i64] :i64
  (if (< i n)
    (let [s (+ sum (vector-at buf i))
          gap (- s received)]
      (if (and (>= gap 0) (<= gap max-fee))
        (+ i 1)
        (if (> gap max-fee) 0 (cover-count-at buf n received max-fee (+ i 1) s))))
    0))

;; 古い順に入金を割り当てたときの、i 件目への額。
(defn allocate [buf :vector-i64 received :i64 i :i64] :i64
  (let [before (allocate-before buf 0 i 0)
        left (- received before)
        due (vector-at buf i)]
    (cond
      (<= left 0) 0
      (< left due) left
      :else due)))

(defn- allocate-before [buf :vector-i64 j :i64 i :i64 acc :i64] :i64
  (if (< j i) (allocate-before buf (+ j 1) i (+ acc (vector-at buf j))) acc))

;; 入金・支払の日付と請求書の日付: 0 発行日より前（前受として別に扱う）、
;; 1 発行日から期日 + window 日まで、2 それより後。
(defn date-fit [issue :i64 due :i64 paid :i64 window :i64] :i64
  (cond
    (< (days-between issue paid) 0) 0
    (<= (days-between due paid) window) 1
    :else 2))

;; 候補の強さ（段の順。点数の重みは使わない）。kind は payment-kind（複数の
;; 請求書なら cover-count で決めた和に対するもの）、ref は摘要に請求書番号が
;; あれば 1、name は振込依頼人名と取引先: 3 確かめた別名、2 正規化して一致、
;; 1 前方一致（切り詰めの可能性があるとき）、0 なし・部分一致。
;; 3 有力、2 中、1 弱い（金額だけ・一部・過入金）、0 出さない。
(defn match-level [kind :i64 ref :i64 name :i64] :i64
  (cond
    (= kind 0) 0
    (or (= kind 3) (= kind 4)) (if (or (= ref 1) (>= name 2)) 1 0)
    (or (= ref 1) (>= name 2)) 3
    (= name 1) 2
    :else 1))

;; --- 仕訳の候補 ------------------------------------------------------------

;; 過去の仕訳から学んだ規則の強さ。hits はこの科目に記帳した回数、total は
;; 同じ鍵（正規化した取引先・摘要と入出金の向き）の回数、in-range は金額が過去の
;; 幅の中なら 1。0 なし、1 弱い（1 回だけ・割合が min-share（basis points）未満・
;; 幅の外）、2 強い。
(defn suggestion-level [hits :i64 total :i64 min-hits :i64 min-share :i64 in-range :i64] :i64
  (cond
    (or (<= hits 0) (<= total 0) (> hits total)) 0
    (and (>= hits min-hits) (>= (* hits 10000) (* min-share total)) (= in-range 1)) 2
    :else 1))

;; --- tests（戻り 1 = pass） ----------------------------------------------

(defn test-valid-entry [] :i64
  (if (= (validate-entry [100 0 0 100]) 0) 1 0))

(defn test-empty [] :i64
  (if (= (validate-entry []) 1) 1 0))

(defn test-odd-buffer [] :i64
  (if (= (validate-entry [100 0 50]) 2) 1 0))

(defn test-negative [] :i64
  (if (= (validate-entry [100 0 -100 0]) 4) 1 0))

(defn test-zero-line [] :i64
  (if (= (validate-entry [100 0 0 100 0 0]) 8) 1 0))

(defn test-both-sides [] :i64
  (if (= (validate-entry [100 0 50 100 0 50]) 16) 1 0))

(defn test-unbalanced [] :i64
  (if (= (validate-entry [100 0 0 90]) 32) 1 0))

(defn test-entry-balanced [] :i64
  (if (= (+ (entry-balanced? [300 0 0 200 0 100])
            (entry-balanced? [100 0 0 90]))
         1)
    1 0))

(defn test-ledger-balanced [] :i64
  (if (= (+ (ledger-balanced? [1 300 0 2 0 300])
            (ledger-balanced? [1 300 0 2 0 200]))
         1)
    1 0))

(defn test-account-net [] :i64
  (if (= (account-net [1 300 0 2 0 300 1 0 50] 1) 250) 1 0))

;; --- 帳票の tests（test/fixtures/parity.edn の :sample と同じ帳簿） --------
;; 会計年度 2026-04-01〜2027-03-31。期首 2026-03-31 に元入金 1,000,000。
;; 売上 330,000・仕入 110,000・家賃 80,000・受取利息 500・支払利息 2,000・
;; 特別利益 5,000・特別損失 10,000・法人税等 30,000・長期借入 200,000。

(defn- sample-ledger [] :vector-i64
  [20260331 1 1000000 0       20260331 6 0 1000000
   20260401 1 200000 0        20260401 5 0 200000
   20260410 1 330000 0        20260410 7 0 330000
   20260420 8 110000 0        20260420 1 0 110000
   20260525 9 80000 0         20260525 1 0 80000
   20260630 1 500 0           20260630 10 0 500
   20260715 11 2000 0         20260715 1 0 2000
   20260801 13 10000 0        20260801 1 0 10000
   20260901 1 5000 0          20260901 12 0 5000
   20270331 14 30000 0        20270331 4 0 30000])

(defn test-class-valid [] :i64
  (if (and (= (class-valid? 0) 0)
           (= (class-valid? 1) 1)
           (= (class-valid? 14) 1)
           (= (class-valid? 15) 0))
    1 0))

(defn test-normal-sign [] :i64
  (if (and (= (normal-sign 1) 1)
           (= (normal-sign 4) -1)
           (= (normal-sign 7) -1)
           (= (normal-sign 0) 0))
    1 0))

(defn test-period-net [] :i64
  (let [b (sample-ledger)]
    (if (and (= (period-net b 1 0 99991231) 1333500)
             (= (period-net b 1 20260401 20270331) 333500)
             (= (period-net b 7 20260401 20270331) -330000)
             (= (period-net b 6 0 20260331) -1000000)
             (= (period-net b 9 20260601 20260630) 0))
      1 0)))

(defn test-class-balance [] :i64
  (let [b (sample-ledger)]
    (if (and (= (class-balance b 7 20260401 20270331) 330000)
             (= (class-balance b 1 0 99991231) 1333500)
             (= (class-balance b 4 0 99991231) 30000)
             (= (class-balance b 8 20260401 20270331) 110000))
      1 0)))

(defn test-profit-stage [] :i64
  (let [b (sample-ledger)]
    (if (and (= (profit-stage b 1 20260401 20270331) 220000)
             (= (profit-stage b 2 20260401 20270331) 140000)
             (= (profit-stage b 3 20260401 20270331) 138500)
             (= (profit-stage b 4 20260401 20270331) 133500)
             (= (profit-stage b 5 20260401 20270331) 103500)
             (= (profit-stage b 0 20260401 20270331) 0)
             (= (profit-stage b 6 20260401 20270331) 0)
             (= (profit-stage b 5 20260401 20260630) 140500))
      1 0)))

(defn test-unclassified-count [] :i64
  (if (and (= (unclassified-count (sample-ledger)) 0)
           (= (unclassified-count [20260101 0 100 0 20260101 1 0 100]) 1)
           (= (unclassified-count []) 0))
    1 0))

(defn test-bs-difference [] :i64
  (if (and (= (bs-difference (sample-ledger) 20270331) 0)
           (= (bs-difference (sample-ledger) 20260331) 0)
           (= (bs-difference [20260101 0 100 0 20260101 1 0 100] 20261231) -100))
    1 0))

(defn test-statement-balanced [] :i64
  (if (and (= (statement-balanced? (sample-ledger) 20270331) 1)
           (= (statement-balanced? [20260101 0 100 0 20260101 1 0 100] 20261231) 0)
           (= (statement-balanced? [20260101 1 100 0 20260101 7 0 90] 20261231) 0))
    1 0))

(defn test-statement-buffer-valid [] :i64
  (if (and (= (statement-buffer-valid? (sample-ledger)) 1)
           (= (statement-buffer-valid? []) 1)
           (= (statement-buffer-valid? [20260101 1 100]) 0)
           (= (statement-buffer-valid? [20260101 15 100 0]) 0)
           (= (statement-buffer-valid? [20260101 1 -100 0]) 0)
           (= (statement-buffer-valid? [-1 1 100 0]) 0))
    1 0))

;; --- 請求書の tests（test/fixtures/parity.edn の請求書の行） ----------------
;; :mixed = [10% 50,000 / 10% 33,333 / 8% 12,345]、:freee = freee ヘルプ
;; 23500770784153 の例（10%: 426・2,100・1,885・220）、:nta57 = 国税庁 Q&A
;; 問 57 の例（税込 10% 60,000・8% 40,000）、:xero-rounding = Xero の
;; 「Rounding in Xero」の例（15%: 25.06・25.61・25.63 をセントで）。

